TOML in c99; v1.0 compliant.

If you are looking for a C++ library, you might try this wrapper:
https://github.com/cktan/tomlcpp.

- Compatible with TOML v1.0.0.
- Tested with multiple test suites, including toml-lang/toml-test and
  iarna/toml-spec-tests.
- Provides very simple and intuitive interface.


